    "<h2> Team Programming challenge </h2>\n",
    "<h3> Determine a graphical solution for $x(a)$ (with at least 6 points) to the transcendental equation: </h3>\n",
    "</div>\n",
    "\n",
    "\\begin{equation}\n",
    "x = \\tanh\\left(\\frac{x}{a} \\right)\n",
    "\\end{equation}"
